## Anatomy

<CodeBlock code={anatomy} filename="App.svelte" />

## API reference

### PreviewCard.Root

<ApiTable props={rootProps} />

`PreviewCard.Trigger` opens on hover (after `delay`), immediately on focus, and toggles on click. `Content` cancels pending closes on hover and dismisses on hover-away (after `closeDelay`) or <Kbd>Esc</Kbd>. `Arrow` centers on the trigger edge like the popover arrow.

## Keyboard interactions

- <Kbd>Tab</Kbd> into the trigger opens the card; <Kbd>Esc</Kbd> closes it.
- Focus stays put — the card is modeless and never steals focus.
